      "comment": "A157: English by Angela Fable, for Kelly's review (Ke86)."
    },
    "En gång om dagen: dagar kvar till provet och 5 snabba frågor. Ingen påminnelse de dagar du redan har övat.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Once a day: days left until the quiz and 5 quick questions. No reminder on days you have already practised."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
